First, you *can't* kill Yeenoghu with a wand of death, since demons
are unaffected by death magic. Second, even if you can kill Yeenoghu
quickly from the upstairs on Elbereth, he may summon monsters who
*don't* respect Elbereth. If you want to be really safe, come back
with a wand of teleportation to get rid of minotaurs/captains that
Yeenoghu summons.

Finally, since Yeenoghu can heal himself and has decent AC, you might
want to buff your weapon a bit if you plan to chop Yeenoghu up. You
could also zap him with cold/lightning.


